      <title>In reversal, U.S. prosecutors seek death for man accused of killing Terre Haute officer</title>
      <link>https://www.ipm.org/news/2025-11-19/in-reversal-u-s-prosecutors-seek-death-for-man-accused-of-killing-terre-haute-officer</link>
      <description>U.S. attorneys filed a notice of intent to seek the death penalty against Shane Meehan in U.S. District Court in Terre Haute on Tuesday. Meehan is accused of killing detective and federal task force agent Gregory Ferency outside an FBI field office in Terre Haute in 2021.</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.ipm.org/news/2025-11-19/in-reversal-u-s-prosecutors-seek-death-for-man-accused-of-killing-terre-haute-officer</guid>
